      "name": "Regression tests, Codex smoke and retest",
      "description": "Add a failing-before/passing-after test for every defect fixed in the previous assignment; add the new test directory to CI; run smoke 6.6 (Codex) and re-run every failed row on the release candidate; security re-review any change under src/hooks/ or adapters/*/hooks; confirm that repeated smoke missions move clean-run counts in .actionboard/registry.json and that the summary matches gate_check.py.",
