        "@type": "DefinedTerm",
        "name": "result",
        "description": "Round 2 on all four CLIs: code-implementation reached 2 clean runs everywhere; Black Agent re-ran Yellow's exact test command on every CLI; /version implemented and tests pass. Two new defects were found and fixed in source (preflight skipped .graphifyignore when a graph already existed; Green handed over a test command whose interpreter is a Windows Store placeholder). Live re-verification of those two fixes is outstanding."
      },
