          "value": "Asks before installing graphifyy 0.9.95; builds ./graphify-out/ offline with no API key; graphify benchmark measured 11-25x fewer tokens per recon question on this repository"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "@type": "DefinedTerm",
      "@id": "urn:voltron:mission:verify-and-release-multi-cli-agent-formation-v1:gap:3",
